					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-252495#post-2661588</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-252495/scp-937#post-2661588</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 27 Sep 2016 13:59:31 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Zathura344</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2372600</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A very nice SCP, one of the few that retain a very realistic tone. I could almost believe this existed, in the same way there are fly traps and pitcher plants, and there exists many plants who use explosive seedpods to disperse their seeds, I love the idea of a plant that creates a hive of insect like creatures! Well done!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
