					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I like this article except for one thing - the last paragraph seems a bit sensational for a clinical report. Specifically this part here: <em>"New subtypes of SCP-937-2 matured, and the various instances of SCP-937 allied to wage a war of extermination upon the leafcutter colonies"</em> It just seems out of place somehow.</p> 
				 	]]>
